                                "sense_id": "abf205be-be47-3797-803a-7dac156f3638",
                                "text": "They heard laughing then, and looked up to see Ann and Bell coming down the street toward them. Ann had plucked a twig of forsythia, and was trying to arrange it in her hair. \"Take that off!\" Bell was saying. \"It's got bugs crawling on it!\""
